      "heading": "B — Audience, level and prerequisites: sharing the road",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, level and prerequisites: sharing the road\nAudience: first-time North Carolina applicants preparing for the regular Class C knowledge test, in English; the truck no-zone distances [A04] and the moped limits [A05] are exact-number recall items.\nLevel: rules for each kind of road user plus equipment and registration law; a no-zone diagram card suits the truck blind areas.\nPrerequisites: the passing section, since passing bicycles follows ordinary passing law, and the hand signals in the vehicle equipment section.\nSensitivity: crash statistics about pedestrians and motorcyclists are stated as printed without dramatization.\n",
